    "code": "class Solution:\r\n    def generate(self, numRows: int) -> List[List[int]]:\r\n        f = [[1]]\r\n        for i in range(numRows - 1):\r\n            g = [1] + [a + b for a, b in pairwise(f[-1])] + [1]\r\n            f.append(g)\r\n        return f",
